{"name":"Fantasy","title":"Fantasy","revision":231489,"url":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/Fantasy","retrieved":"2026-09-06","license":"CC BY-SA","licenseUrl":"https://www.fandom.com/licensing","language":"en","blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Fantasy is a literary genre set in imagined worlds, drawing inspiration from mythology and folklore. Originating in oral traditions, it evolved into written literature and dramatic works. The genre is commonly associated with epic high fantasy, often featuring medieval European influences. However, fantasy encompasses diverse settings and styles, including both high and low fantasy."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Visual"},{"kind":"list","text":"Sunlit landscapes"},{"kind":"list","text":"Forests"},{"kind":"list","text":"Castles"},{"kind":"list","text":"Ruins of old buildings and castles"},{"kind":"list","text":"Mist, sunrise, sunset"},{"kind":"list","text":"Swords and daggers"},{"kind":"list","text":"Scrolls of parchment"},{"kind":"list","text":"Books, both old and new"},{"kind":"list","text":"Crystal, gemstones and stones"},{"kind":"list","text":"Handmade wands"},{"kind":"list","text":"Old maps"},{"kind":"list","text":"Potions and poisons"},{"kind":"list","text":"Tiny potion bottles"},{"kind":"list","text":"Interesting keys"},{"kind":"list","text":"Horses, wolves and other animals"},{"kind":"list","text":"Dragons"},{"kind":"list","text":"Tiny chests"},{"kind":"list","text":"Beautiful waterfalls"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Fashion"},{"kind":"list","text":"Long cloaks"},{"kind":"list","text":"Loose hooded trench coats, with lots of inner pockets"},{"kind":"list","text":"White poet shirts (or just regular white shirts with puff sleeves)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Cool leather belts, all of 'em"},{"kind":"list","text":"Brown corduroy jeans"},{"kind":"list","text":"Combat or leather boots"},{"kind":"list","text":"Medieval style/viking fashion"},{"kind":"list","text":"Brass accessories"},{"kind":"list","text":"Hair combs"},{"kind":"list","text":"Brass belts"},{"kind":"list","text":"Linen dresses"},{"kind":"list","text":"Princess dresses"},{"kind":"list","text":"Ball gowns"},{"kind":"list","text":"Corsets"},{"kind":"list","text":"Crowns or tiaras"},{"kind":"list","text":"Knives, daggers, or swords"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Activities"},{"kind":"list","text":"Reading a fantasy book by a tree"},{"kind":"list","text":"Binge watching fantasy movies and TV shows"},{"kind":"list","text":"Imagining whole new realms while meditating"},{"kind":"list","text":"Writing your own stories and tales never written nor told before"},{"kind":"list","text":"Creating original characters"},{"kind":"list","text":"Archery"},{"kind":"list","text":"Fencing"},{"kind":"list","text":"Playing Dungeons and Dragons with your party till midnight"},{"kind":"list","text":"Throwing daggers or knives"},{"kind":"list","text":"Horse riding"},{"kind":"list","text":"Spending time with all of your animal friends"},{"kind":"list","text":"Art; draw, paint and craft to your heart's content"},{"kind":"list","text":"Embroidery, weaving, spinning, or other historical crafts"},{"kind":"list","text":"Being in nature, walking through the woods"},{"kind":"list","text":"Nurturing your plants/pets"},{"kind":"list","text":"Chilling in a treehouse"},{"kind":"list","text":"Playing tabletop roleplaying games"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Subgenres"},{"kind":"list","text":"Nautical Fantasy"},{"kind":"list","text":"Dark Fantasy"},{"kind":"list","text":"Urban Fantasy"},{"kind":"list","text":"Medieval Fantasy"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Media"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Anime & Manga"},{"kind":"list","text":"Sailor Moon"},{"kind":"list","text":"A Lull In The Sea"},{"kind":"list","text":"Jewelpet"},{"kind":"list","text":"Spice and Wolf"},{"kind":"list","text":"Seven Deadly Sins"},{"kind":"list","text":"Frieren: Beyond Journey's End"},{"kind":"list","text":"Delicious in Dungeon"},{"kind":"list","text":"Witch hat Atelier"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Liter